  "description": "A text type for .NET that stores UTF-8, UTF-16, or UTF-32 data behind a single API. Work with Text, not bytes or chars — search, slice, and mutate without transcoding. Ships Text, TextSpan, OwnedText, TextBuilder, and typed Utf8Text/Utf16Text/Utf32Text views. Encoding-independent equality, ArrayPool-backed mutation variants, zero-alloc slicing, and Rune enumeration.",
  "id": "Glot",
